[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1200.47, "timestamp": "00:20:00", "text": "请随意点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1202.23, "timestamp": "00:20:02", "text": "如果你愿意的话，也可以顺便去一趟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1205.27, "timestamp": "00:20:05", "text": "Dame的演讲能力究竟发挥了什么作用？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1211.029, "timestamp": "00:20:11", "text": "呃，我觉得兄弟就是在放松享受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1213.59, "timestamp": "00:20:13", "text": "就像他也在和一群人睡觉一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1218.63, "timestamp": "00:20:18", "text": "现在感觉就像在伸展身体一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1221.029, "timestamp": "00:20:21", "text": "他只是……嗯，他只是在伸展身体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1223.51, "timestamp": "00:20:23", "text": "现在。他好像准备好了，就像范一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1226.47, "timestamp": "00:20:26", "text": "就像吹口哨一样。她吹口哨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1228.23, "timestamp": "00:20:28", "text": "这样她就会站起来，就像，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1230.23, "timestamp": "00:20:30", "text": "知道了，就来参加派对吧。他没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1233.59, "timestamp": "00:20:33", "text": "真的，你知道，需要和她谈谈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1234.07, "timestamp": "00:20:34", "text": "很公平。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1234.789, "timestamp": "00:20:34", "text": "她只是跟着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1237.83, "timestamp": "00:20:37", "text": "我应该事先做些调查研究。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1241.029, "timestamp": "00:20:41", "text": "我拿到你的电话号码了。嗯，请随意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1242.39, "timestamp": "00:20:42", "text": "开始向前迈进，然后说：“你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1243.75, "timestamp": "00:20:43", "text": "有人要来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1245.19, "timestamp": "00:20:45", "text": "我们弄到了东西。我们得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1246.549, "timestamp": "00:20:46", "text": "冒险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1248.39, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "text": "我们走吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1250.23, "timestamp": "00:20:50", "text": "我遇到一点小问题。哦，显然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1251.669, "timestamp": "00:20:51", "text": "不知为何，它告诉我我是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1253.19, "timestamp": "00:20:53", "text": "火炬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1255.59, "timestamp": "00:20:55", "text": "哦，等等。什么？什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1256.87, "timestamp": "00:20:56", "text": "你就是火炬。"}]